# Service account keys / secrets
# NOTE: do NOT use a blanket *.json here — it hides package.json, tsconfig.json,
# package-lock.json and other config the project needs. Target secrets only:
*service-account*.json
*key*.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.p12

